WEBVTT

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.570
So the cultural festival is finally on!

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.560
In order to successfully make the horror house that everyone worked hard to prepare,

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:16.780
I'll do my best!

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:29.040
The monument designed by Misho-san,

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:30.740
It's really good, isn't it?

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.280
Yeah, it's very dynamic.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.220
Thank you. I'm very happy to hear that.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.200
Good morning!

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:39.130
Sally!

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.740
Why are you late?

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:43.260
I'm sorry. I knew it was an alarm clock.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:48.270
It was such a big alarm clock, but you couldn't wake up?

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:52.790
It was a present, but it didn't make sense.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:59.530
Everyone who was late was in hell.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.520
You're going to fall!

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.870
You're going to go to hell and hell, aren't you?

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.220
Even Enma-sama wouldn't laugh at that kind of joke.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:10.940
Huh?

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.310
I can't do it?

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:17.250
Huh?

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:18.580
Hmm...

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:19.420
The others were pretty good.

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:22.200
Well, this happens sometimes.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.380
Let's do our best for the next 3 hours!

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:33.020
Eh? Eh?

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:36.000
Alright, let's go!

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:00.390
It hurts!

00:02:41.196 --> 00:02:41.576
She said

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:06.390
It's time for the last one!

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:07.890
The bird is the best!

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.710
It's this big?

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:11.670
What?

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:14.170
It's not like it's your first time seeing it, right?

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:15.980
Uh, yeah...

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:16.720
Well...

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:17.610
With this many seats,

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:19.940
not just family and relatives,

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:22.200
but whoever comes, it'll be a mess!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:23.240
Huh?

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:24.250
What?

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:26.190
Are you scared?

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:27.860
Ah, no...

00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:28.650
Ugh...

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:29.680
In a place like this,

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:30.940
What are you going to do about it?

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.400
In the future, we're going to be a dome stadium!

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.840
No, we're going to have a bigger foreign stage!

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:38.240
We're going to be a big-ass entertainer!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.630
This place is so small!

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:11.900
I can do muscle training, but I guess I can't beat Precure with just that.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:17.550
That's how it is!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:22.880
Our goal is to defeat Precure and obtain the Sun's Pond.

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:28.800
Then we'll have a chance to win for sure!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.140
It was necessary to do something.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:35.440
Don't make me say it again.

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.040
It doesn't make sense to get Izumi with an old-fashioned method.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:41.310
It's a fight from the beginning to the end.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:47.280
Are you going to fight as hard as you can?

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:52.780
That's right. That posture is...

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.080
It opens the way to victory, right?

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.970
Yeah, you're starting to understand.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:04.300
Hmm, looks like I still need more training!

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.960
Hehe, that was tough.

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:17.840
Begur!

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:23.650
We won't make it in time for the meeting!

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:29.770
I can't see!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.310
That's really good!

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:32.430
Let's try it!

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:35.660
Alright!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.620
Looks like we can do it!

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:42.350
Explain the reason!

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:46.770
Manzai!

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:48.450
I suddenly said that Miyasako was going to quit.

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:50.430
What?

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.820
When I saw that stage, I got scared and became Miyasako.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.540
No, that's...

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.220
So, what is it?

00:05:58.480 --> 00:05:59.880
For me, it's definitely...

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:00.460
I can't do it.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.160
It's not like that.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:04.340
I'm going to tell the teacher that I can't go out.

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:06.100
Hey!

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.340
Hey!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:09.310
Yasako!

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.830
Is it okay?

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:18.130
I can't do it with gum tape.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:22.170
I can't really put customers in this.

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:34.140
Um, I don't have a wire, so I got this instead.

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:49.570
Everyone, stand by at the designated place.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:53.050
Stand by? What are you going to do?

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:10.390
I'm confident!

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:11.740
More than that!

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:14.810
I'll ask Hyuga-san to do it!

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:15.230
Look!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:17.360
Okay!

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:24.330
Please go ahead!

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:57.630
What happened to Chiyoshino-kun and the others?

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:01.340
Ota-san!

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:03.020
You're boring!

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:06.030
It's my turn, Ota-san!

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:06.250
Wow!

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:11.750
Tomorrow...

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:29.700
Tomorrow...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.690
Hey, John. Why aren't you flying today?

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.910
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:39.460
Wait a minute!

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:41.180
I told you I don't want to!

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.880
Well, just listen to me, Miyasako!

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:44.960
Leave me alone!

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:49.440
Fine. I'm going to keep running to Akamono Matsune.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:02.280
No!

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:11.330
If you're weak,

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:14.520
That's not what I'm talking about, Choppi!

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:14.980
Ah!

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:17.280
Choppi!

00:09:31.372 --> 00:09:33.372
Thank you for watching!

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:57.340
Kuku, what should I do?

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:29.770
Let's meet again next time.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.320
What do you mean by being alive?

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.300
What did you do that scared you the most?

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.440
I didn't do anything.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.400
But I think you had fun anyway.

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:46.160
That's right.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.030
Then we have to fix it during this break.

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:53.040
What are Kenta and the others doing?

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.130
I wonder what happened.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:57.320
I'm really worried.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:10.370
It's about time to start.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:28.520
Miyasako, think again!

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:36.940
Miyasako-kun, is there a reason why you don't want to appear in other shows?

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:39.550
Eh? Other shows?

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:42.180
What are you talking about, Miyasako-kun?

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:43.600
Ah, no...

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:47.920
Actually, I didn't tell my family that I was going to do a manzai.

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:48.780
Eh?

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:51.850
It's our stage! Why?

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.200
Because I don't have confidence.

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:56.420
But that's why...

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:58.640
My family is here today.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:11:59.900
Even more so...

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.620
If I show it to you, you can see how much I practiced.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.760
That's why my family doesn't think that I'm going to do a manzai.

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:12.320
Before that, I thought that I might be able to see a bad-looking appearance.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.450
I was very disappointed.

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:24.150
I didn't have any confidence at all.

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:29.760
Thinking about the design of a small monument is a big pressure.

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:38.510
But at that time, thanks to Saki's encouragement and the cooperation of everyone in the class, I thought that I was not alone.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:44.590
If I'm with everyone, I'll be brave. I tried to put that feeling into that monument.

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:47.360
Misho-san...

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:50.380
That's right! Miyasako-kun also has someone to support!

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:55.080
Kenta is a little unreliable, but he is an important partner!

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.980
Huh? Unreliable is an extra word!

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:03.260
We'll cheer for you guys too!

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.980
That's right! We're always together!

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:07.470
It's okay! It'll definitely work out!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:08.970
I guarantee it!

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:12.180
If you fail, I'll follow you!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.910
Hey, Miyasako, let's try it!

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.560
Miyasako-kun!

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:25.620
Miyasako!

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:28.700
Everyone, do your best!

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:34.470
Let's jump tomorrow!

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:40.000
I'll do my best too.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:41.350
Then let's practice!

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:42.890
We don't have time until the actual show!

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.310
Ah, wait!

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:46.610
We're also...

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:46.890
Look!

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:49.220
I'm really motivated!

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:51.700
Let's dance!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:52.540
Everyone, wait!

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:57.920
Glorious friendship!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.670
But that doesn't make any sense.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:03.720
The most important thing is...

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.280
to win the match!

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:25.400
Don't you say that the people of Midori no Sato,

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:25.800
who are suitable for the battlefield,

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:26.610
are fighting behind the gym?

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.040
That doesn't make any sense!

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:38.640
If you really want to go, then you'll have to defeat me first!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:42.050
Aki! Hurry up and transform, Pi!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:33.450
Looks like you're up for it, huh?

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.730
That's what I'm talking about!

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.700
Koho, it's rare to see you so active today.

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:06.060
There's something I have to do with everyone!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.840
Time's up!

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:11.300
Useless! Useless!

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:13.250
What's the point of this kind of festival?

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:17.300
Everything that can't win or lose has no meaning!

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:18.180
That's right!

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:23.240
Don't stay in your heart for a little while!

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:26.400
Useless!

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.440
Wait, useless!

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:29.630
Useless!

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:48.920
It's too late.

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:56.940
The boy was afraid of failure.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:59.720
Failure equals defeat.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.750
Because those memories will remain in him forever.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:29.040
I don't care if you lose!

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:34.960
No matter how many times I fail, I don't know if I'll be able to challenge with natto!

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:36.980
It's too sweet!

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:37.660
It's too sweet!

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:40.600
It's weird to decide everything by winning or losing!

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:42.840
You're so annoying!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.360
What's wrong? Is this your power?

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:54.380
It's a power!

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.400
I'll definitely go with an all-out battle next time!

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:07.020
It was a great success.

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:09.180
The festival is over today.

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:12.800
Hey, isn't that Hoshino's stage?

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:14.750
Let's go, let's go!

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:19.140
Let's go, let's go!

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:25.580
I'm Miyasako.

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:28.920
I'm Kenta and Sako.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.520
In the end, that name... I don't like it.

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:37.420
By the way, Sakocchi, what blood type are you?

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:38.660
Um...

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:39.320
I'm a Kua type!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:42.560
What? A blood type type and a Kua type type?

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.360
Even a beetle won't laugh at such a joke.

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:50.670
Huh? Sakocchi laughed, huh?

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:52.730
No, your joke is not funny.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:54.990
Wait a minute, I don't want to say that.

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:03.400
Miyasako-kun, you're so energetic!

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:05.130
I know, right?

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:07.750
If only Kenta's pun was a little bit better.

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:11.060
Ah, y-you're right.

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:15.450
It looks like the cultural festival we all worked so hard for is going to end safely.

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.270
Yeah, you did a good job.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:19.190
Huh?

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:20.720
I think it's all thanks to Saki that Horror House succeeded.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.520
That's not true!

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:29.320
Mai, I thought about it again.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:36.480
If you're alone, you'll be anxious and not confident, but if you're with everyone, you'll be able to do your best!

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:40.120
Yeah, so I'll do my best!

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:44.540
Let's jump tomorrow with Mai!

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:47.500
Kirin's eyes are so sharp!

00:21:48.360 --> 00:21:49.940
You want to say it's sharp, right?

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:52.000
But, Kirin has a kind eye that's unique to animals.

00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:57.580
I've said this before, but this pun is not funny at all.

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:02.780
Hehehe!

00:23:50.090 --> 00:23:52.010
I'm sad that I have to say goodbye.

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:53.790
Don't talk to me without permission!

00:23:54.190 --> 00:23:57.950
I want to say goodbye to that Pika Pika!

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:01.040
Splashes are born!

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:06.540
Hyuga, Saki, Gojo!
